<title>USA: F &amp; M Bancorp completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>F &amp; M Bancorp completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>KAUKAUNA, Wis. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>F &amp; M Bancorporation Inc, a Wisconsin-based bank holding company, said Monday it has completed the acquisition of Prairie City Bank.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Prairie City was a wholly-owned subsidiary of Wisconsin Ban Corp with five offices in western Wisconsin and about $85 million in assets.</p>
<p>F &amp; M shares were down 1/8 at 31-5/8 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
